To cite package 'snowman' in publications, use:

  Niittynen, Pekka. (2026). snowman: an open-source R package for automated 30-m snow and ice cover mapping using the Landsat archive. EarthArXiv. https://doi.org/10.31223/X5FF32

A BibTeX entry for LaTeX users is:

  @article{niittynen2026snowman,
    title={snowman: an open-source R package for automated 30-m snow and ice cover mapping using the Landsat archive},
    author={Niittynen, Pekka},
    year={2026},
    url = {https://doi.org/10.31223/X5FF32},
    publisher={EarthArXiv}
  }